<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IXC Comm started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IXC Comm started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of IXC Communications Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The shares rose 1/4 to 23-1/4 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
